## ---------------------------------------------------------------
## ChamaLink - .gitignore ya root (.NET + Node)
## Hii ilikuwa haipo, na kwa sababu hiyo faili 246 za bin/obj
## zilikuwa zimeingia kwenye git (.git ilikuwa 15 MB).
## ---------------------------------------------------------------

### .NET build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
artifacts/
publish/
*.binlog

### .NET / MSBuild
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.svclog
*.scc
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

### Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code
.vs/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
# launch.json/tasks.json zinaruhusiwa kwa makusudi: zinafanya F5 ifanye kazi
# kwa watumiaji wote wa VS Code bila usanidi wa ziada. Hazina siri.
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

### Test results & coverage
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
TestResults/

### Node / frontend
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
.vite/
*.local
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.eslintcache

### Siri / environment  -- USIZIWEKE KWENYE GIT
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
appsettings.*.local.json
*.pfx
*.snk

### OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

### EF Core bundles / scripts zilizozalishwa
*.dacpac
*.jfm
